        "original_id": "3dadc267-8220-5b6b-a10f-e723e20435ba",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Flula Borg, Alex Simmons, David Giuntoli\n- Works: Buddymoon, Honey Buddies, Pitch Perfect 2\n- Topics: Film careers, entertainment recognition\n\nFacts:\n- Flula Borg was born on March 28, 1982, and he is a German actor, comedian, musician, and YouTube personality known as DJ Flula or simply Flula.\n- In 2015, The Hollywood Reporter named Flula Borg one of its Top 25 Digital Stars, and Variety named him one of its 10 Comics to Watch.\n- In 2016, the American independent comedy film Buddymoon was released after previously being known as Honey Buddies.\n- Alex Simmons directed Buddymoon, and Alex Simmons, Flula Borg, and David Giuntoli wrote the film.\n- Flula Borg and David Giuntoli starred in Buddymoon.\n- Flula Borg has appeared in several feature films, including Pitch Perfect 2, and in a number of popular television shows.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
